# =============================================================================
# Build context for dotFlySim2.
#
# The image needs exactly three things from this repository:
#
#     psdk_interfaces/     the message package, built into the image
#     px4-patches/         compiled into PX4's SITL binary
#     vendor/              optional offline PX4 / QGroundControl archives
#
# Everything else is MOUNTED at run time by walker and must not be baked in —
# see the Dockerfile header. Excluding it here keeps the build context small
# (models/ and bags/ are the big ones) and, more importantly, means editing a
# world or a mission can never invalidate a layer and trigger a rebuild.
# =============================================================================

# Exclude everything by default, then re-admit what the build actually reads.
*

!psdk_interfaces/
!px4-patches/
!vendor/

# ...but never the heavyweight or generated things inside those.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/build/
**/install/
**/log/
**/.git/
